      }
    ],
    "status": "present",
    "value": "Each user bids once. Shares go to price levels from highest to lowest. If a level's total requested shares fit in the remaining shares, every bidder there receives their full request. Otherwise the remaining shares are handed out one at a time round-robin over that level's bidders ordered by timestamp (ties by input order), skipping bidders already satisfied, until shares run out. Return the sorted userIds that receive zero shares."
  },
